Subject: [PATCH] imx95: Update device tree and board files for AOM-5521 MAC
 address handling

- Change flash node name in device tree for consistency.
- Add support for reading MAC addresses from SPI NOR for AOM-5521.
- Introduce USB OTG regulator and GPIO configurations in device tree.
- Refactor memory size definitions in header file for clarity.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific]
